{
 "esm": "1.2.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "ifelse_mixed_boxes_dynamic",
  "description": "An `ifelse` whose condition is a runtime SCALAR and whose branches have different shapes (a scalar `0.0` or a scalar observed against an array element), the eqice `strain_term` shape, with the condition false, true, and (dynamic variant) flipping during the run on a state. Dynamic variant: the same rules beside a state whose right-hand side reads them, so they are lowered on the run-time path.",
  "authors": [
   "EarthSciML Authors and Contributors"
  ],
  "tags": [
   "native",
   "conformance"
  ]
 },
